# Store text with LF and check it out however the platform wants it, so a
# checkout on Windows and one on Linux do not show each other as changed.
* text=auto

# Binary, so git neither rewrites line endings in them nor tries to diff them.
# They are small enough that LFS would cost more than it saves: the test ROM is
# 32 KiB and each screenshot is about 4 KiB.
*.gb binary
*.gbc binary
*.png binary
